{
    "name": "戶外活動",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，<br>討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！"
            },
            {
                "text": "Kadafa, o pa’aliwacan anocila, wa tatalacowaaw kiso?",
                "textCh": "Kadafa，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65611/918032",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Wa tatala’alo kako aci Pongay mi’id’id to titi anocila, kiso i?",
                "textCh": "我明天要和Pongay去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65611/918033",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Hato nga’ayay a halama a tengilen! Manga’ay kako malacafay tayla haw?",
                "textCh": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65611/918034",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Licayen ho iso ci wina.",
                "textCh": "你先問媽媽！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65611/918035",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Ina, manga’ay kako mihakalong ci kakaan malacafay tayra i ’alo han?",
                "textCh": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65611/918036",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Nga’ayay to, nikaorira pina’on kamo yo!",
                "textCh": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65611/918037",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-3.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Hay, mafana’ to a mina’on kami.",
                "textCh": "沒問題，我們一定會的！Hay， mafana' to kami.",
                "sound": "text/sound/65611/918038",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            }
        ],
